-- ===========================================================================
-- Warlock: Ruin redesign -- crits spread Immolate
-- ===========================================================================
--
-- TODO.md: "No longer affects Imp. Instead critical hits on targets with
--           Immolate active spread Immolate to nearby targets (so long as
--           those targets aren't CCed with something that breaks on damage)"
--
-- Ranks: 17959 / 59738 / 59739 / 59740 / 59741 (talent 967, Destruction).
--
-- Effect1 (crit damage bonus) is kept, but EffectSpellClassMaskA1 narrows
-- from 5093 to 997.  5093 - 4096 = 997, and 0x1000 (4096) is Firebolt --
-- so this drops the Imp from the talent, which is the first half of the
-- change.  MaskA2 (12783808) is unchanged.
--
-- Effect2 is added as a SPELL_AURA_DUMMY whose amount carries the spread
-- radius in yards.  EffectDieSides2 = 0, and SpellEffectInfo::CalcValue
-- returns BasePoints unchanged when DieSides is 0 (SpellInfo.cpp:431), so
-- EffectBasePoints2 = 15 reads back as exactly 15 yards.  Effect2's own
-- class masks (B1/B2/B3) are already 0 and stay that way.
--
-- The spread itself is spell_warl_ruin_immolate_spread
-- (src/WarlockRuin.cpp), which handles rank preservation, the
-- crowd-control exclusion, and a 4-target cap.
--
-- spell_proc gating: HitMask 2 = PROC_HIT_CRITICAL, and Cooldown 1000 is
-- essential -- without a 1s ICD a Rain of Fire tick storm would re-run the
-- spread on every tick against every target.
-- ===========================================================================



